Structure Terraform into reusable modules.

terraform/
│
├── modules/
│   ├── vpc/
│   ├── security-group/
│   ├── alb/
│   ├── ec2/
│   ├── rds/
│   └── storage/
│
├── environments/
│   ├── dev/
│   ├── qa/
│   └── prod/
│
└── README.md

Example:

modules/
    vpc
       main.tf
       variables.tf
       outputs.tf

    ec2
       main.tf
       variables.tf
       outputs.tf

    rds
       main.tf
       variables.tf
       outputs.tf
13. Terraform Design

Use environment-specific variables.

dev.tfvars

environment = "dev"

app_instance_count = 2

app_instance_type = "t3.large"

db_instance_class = "db.t3.medium"

Production:

prod.tfvars

environment = "prod"

app_instance_count = 6

app_instance_type = "m6i.large"

db_instance_class = "db.r6g.large"

The key point:

Same Terraform modules, different environment-specific configuration.
